          {
            "title": "Question: One indent",
            "id": 107740,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum ist das Hinzufügen einer <code>if</code>-Anweisung innerhalb einer Funktion nützlich?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es ermöglicht uns, das Verhalten der Funktion basierend auf einer Bedingung zu ändern</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es ist dasselbe wie das Hinzufügen einer anderen Anweisung innerhalb einer Funktion</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es macht unsere Funktion kleiner und leichter lesbar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es ermöglicht uns, das Verhalten der Funktion basierend auf einer Bedingung zu ändern.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In einer Funktion gibt <code>if (score &gt; 50)</code> <code>High</code> aus. Nach dem if-Block wird <code>Done</code> ausgegeben.</p><p>Du rufst sie mit einer Punktzahl von <code>40</code> auf. Was erscheint?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nur <code>Done</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>High</code>, dann <code>Done</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Keine der beiden Nachrichten.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nur <code>Done</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 107735,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die Funktion mit dem Wert (Argument) auf, der <code>\"Passed!\"</code> in der Konsole anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGrade\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGrade(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>80</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die Funktion mit einer Punktzahl auf, die den Zweig <code>Passed!</code> statt des Fehlerzweigs erreicht.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGrade\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGrade(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>80</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 107734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code die <code>if</code>-Anweisung so, dass beide Nachrichten in der Konsole ausgegeben werden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can you trust him?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Can you trust him?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>===</code>, gefolgt von <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Code blocks",
            "id": 107733,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die Funktion mit dem Argument auf, das zu einem um 10% reduzierten Preis führt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"discountedPrice\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"cost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discountedPrice(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"238\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"720\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>800</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die Funktion mit Kosten aus der Rabattstufe von 10 % auf, nicht aus der Stufe ohne Rabatt oder mit 20 %.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"discountedPrice\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"cost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discountedPrice(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"238\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"720\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>800</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple instructions",
            "id": 107732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die Bedingungsanweisung, um das Gehalt, das an die <code>getTaxedSalary()</code>-Funktion übergeben wird, korrekt zu besteuern, wenn es mehr als 2.500 beträgt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - (salary * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2380\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>(salary &gt; 2500)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wende Steuer nur an, wenn der Wert von <code>getTaxedSalary()</code> über 2.500 liegt, nicht wenn <code>income</code> später darüber liegt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - (salary * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &gt;= 2500)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2380\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>(salary &gt; 2500)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparing one value",
            "id": 107878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code die Bedingungsanweisung, um einen Kinderrabatt anzuwenden, falls zutreffend.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; year(s): children's discount applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 year(s): children's discount applies!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>age</code>, gefolgt von <code>&lt;=</code> und schließlich <code>10</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wende den Rabatt auf das an die Funktion übergebene Kindesalter an, einschließlich des Alters 10.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; year(s): children's discount applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 year(s): children's discount applies!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>age</code>, gefolgt von <code>&lt;=</code> und schließlich <code>10</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparing two values",
            "id": 107877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konstruiere die Bedingung innerhalb der <code>if</code>-Anweisung, um die Ausgabe korrekt zuzuordnen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGreater\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGreater(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14 is greater than or equal to 13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>(</code>, gefolgt von <code>a</code> und schließlich <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die Bedingung, die die Nachricht ausgibt, wenn die erste Zahl größer oder gleich der zweiten ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGreater\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGreater(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14 is greater than or equal to 13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>(</code>, gefolgt von <code>a</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Greater value",
            "id": 107876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code die <code>if else</code> Anweisung, um die Funktion zu vervollständigen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEquality\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers are equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers aren't equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEquality(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Numbers are equal\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if (a === b)</code>, gefolgt von <code>else</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die Gleichheitsentscheidung, sodass gleiche Eingaben die erste und andere Eingaben die zweite Nachricht verwenden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEquality\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers are equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers aren't equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEquality(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a = b)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Numbers are equal\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if (a === b)</code>, gefolgt von <code>else</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple times",
            "id": 107875,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige <code>Logging in</code> in der Konsole an, indem du die Funktion mit dem richtigen Passwort aufrufst.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>checkPassword</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die vorhandene Passwortfunktion mit dem gespeicherten Passwort auf, sodass sie <code>Logging in...</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;party1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>checkPassword</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code>, <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code> und schließlich <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of a function",
            "id": 107899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Zweck einer <code>return</code>-Anweisung?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um einen Wert aus einer Funktion zurückzugeben</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um einen Wert in der Konsole anzuzeigen</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um eine zuvor definierte Funktion aufzurufen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um einen Wert aus einer Funktion zurückzugeben.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Funktion führt <code>console.log(price)</code> aus, dann <code>return price - 5</code>.</p><p>Du übergibst <code>20</code>. Welchen Wert erhält der Aufrufer?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>15</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sowohl <code>20</code> als auch <code>15</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Nothing gets executed",
            "id": 107900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn eine return-Anweisung vor Anweisungen in einer Funktion platziert wird, wenn die Funktion aufgerufen wird?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Anweisungen nach dem return-Statement werden nicht ausgeführt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Anweisungen vor der return-Anweisung werden nicht ausgeführt</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktion ist ungültig und wird überhaupt nicht ausgeführt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Anweisungen nach dem return-Statement werden nicht ausgeführt.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In einer Funktion folgt <code>console.log(result);</code> auf <code>return result;</code>. Was geschieht mit der Ausgabezeile?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sie läuft nicht, weil die Funktion bereits einen Wert zurückgegeben hat.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sie läuft, bevor der Rückgabewert zurückgesendet wird.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sie macht die Funktion ungültig.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sie läuft nicht, weil die Funktion bereits einen Wert zurückgegeben hat.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple return statements",
            "id": 107901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche <code>return</code>-Anweisung(en) wird/werden in diesem Code ausgeführt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die erste return-Anweisung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die zweite return-Anweisung</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Beide return-Anweisungen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die erste return-Anweisung.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du vertauschst die beiden <code>return</code>-Zeilen und lässt den Aufruf unverändert. Welcher Wert wird nun <code>result</code> zugewiesen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>39</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Beide Werte werden kombiniert.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>39</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return in if statements",
            "id": 107909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige die Nachricht <code>With honors</code> an, indem du die Rückgabeanweisungen an die richtige Position setzt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>return \"With honors\";</code>, gefolgt von <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib für eine qualifizierende Note <code>With honors</code> zurück und die andere Nachricht erst nach dem Ende der Bedingung.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return &quot;No honors&quot;;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>return \"With honors\";</code>, gefolgt von <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Catch last case",
            "id": 107910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Führe die letzte return-Anweisung aus, indem du den korrekten Wert codierst.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setOven\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too cold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too hot&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = setOven(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Just right\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>400</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib unter <code>375</code> <code>Too cold</code> und über <code>425</code> <code>Too hot</code> zurück.</p><p>Vervollständige beide Vergleiche und wähle eine Eingabe, die <code>Just right</code> zurückgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setOven\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &lt; \" /><text value=\"375\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too cold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"425\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Too hot&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Just right&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = setOven(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"161\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"300\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Just right\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;</code>, gefolgt von <code>&gt;</code> und schließlich <code>400</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      }
